{"book":"kinney","chapter":"visual-studio-code","chapterTitle":"Visual Studio Code","slug":"compound-tasks-vscode","title":"المهام المركّبة","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"فهم-اعتماديات-المهام-dependson-و-dependsorder","text":"فهم اعتماديات المهام: dependsOn و dependsOrder"},{"depth":3,"id":"sequence-الافتراضي","text":"sequence (الافتراضي)"},{"depth":3,"id":"parallel","text":"parallel"},{"depth":3,"id":"any","text":"any"},{"depth":3,"id":"دمج-الاعتماديات","text":"دمج الاعتماديات"}],"html":"<p>تتيح لك المهام المركّبة تشغيل مهام متعددة بالتتابع. ويفيد ذلك في تنسيق مسارات عمل معقّدة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;version&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2.0.0&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;tasks&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Task A&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;shell&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;command&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;echo Task A&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Task B&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;shell&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;command&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;echo Task B&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Run A and B&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Task A&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Task B&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOrder&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;sequence&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;problemMatcher&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<ul>\n<li><code>&quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;Task A&quot;, &quot;Task B&quot;]</code> : ستشغّل مهمة <code>Run A and B</code> المهام ذات الوسمين <code>Task A</code> و <code>Task B</code>.</li>\n<li><code>&quot;dependsOrder&quot;: &quot;sequence&quot;</code>: ستُشغَّل المهام بالترتيب المعرّف في مصفوفة <code>dependsOn</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"فهم-اعتماديات-المهام-dependson-و-dependsorder\">فهم اعتماديات المهام: <code>dependsOn</code> و <code>dependsOrder</code></h2>\n<p>عند تنسيق مهام متعددة، تحتاج إلى التحكّم في المهام التي تُشغَّل (<code>dependsOn</code>) وفي طريقة تشغيلها بالنسبة إلى بعضها (<code>dependsOrder</code>). وتقبل خاصية <code>dependsOrder</code> ثلاث قيم، لكل منها سلوك مختلف:</p>\n<h3 id=\"sequence-الافتراضي\"><code>sequence</code> (الافتراضي)</h3>\n<p>تعمل المهام تسلسليًا بالترتيب المذكور تمامًا في مصفوفة <code>dependsOn</code>. ويجب أن تكتمل كل مهمة قبل أن تبدأ التالية.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Sequential Build and Test&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Clean&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Build&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Test&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOrder&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;sequence&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>وهذا يضمن انتهاء “Clean” قبل بدء “Build”، وانتهاء “Build” قبل بدء “Test”. وإذا فشلت أي مهمة، فلا تعمل المهام اللاحقة.</p>\n<h3 id=\"parallel\"><code>parallel</code></h3>\n<p>تبدأ كل المهام التابعة في الوقت نفسه وتعمل بالتوازي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Parallel Assets Build&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Compile CSS&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Compile JavaScript&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Optimize Images&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOrder&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;parallel&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>وهذا يطلق مهام ترجمة الأصول الثلاث كلها دفعة واحدة، ما يمكن أن يسرّع أوقات البناء بدرجة كبيرة للعمليات المستقلة.</p>\n<h3 id=\"any\"><code>any</code></h3>\n<p>يبدأ Visual Studio Code المهام بالتوازي، لكن المهمة الرئيسية تكتمل بمجرد انتهاء أي مهمة تابعة. ويفيد ذلك في سيناريوهات «حالة التسابق».</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Development Server&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Start API Server&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Start Frontend Server&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOrder&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;any&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>وفي هذا المثال، تُعدّ مهمة “Development Server” مكتملة عندما يبدأ خادم الـ API أو خادم الواجهة الأمامية بنجاح.</p>\n<h3 id=\"دمج-الاعتماديات\">دمج الاعتماديات</h3>\n<p>يمكنك إنشاء أشجار مهام معقّدة بدمج الاعتماديات. مثلًا:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;version&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;2.0.0&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;tasks&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Clean&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;shell&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;command&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rm -rf dist&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Build Frontend&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;shell&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;command&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;npm run build:frontend&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Clean&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Build Backend&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;shell&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;command&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;npm run build:backend&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Clean&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Run Tests&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;type&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;shell&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;command&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;npm test&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Build Frontend&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Build Backend&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOrder&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;sequence&quot;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;label&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Full Pipeline&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;dependsOn&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Run Tests&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;problemMatcher&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>في هذا المثال:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>تعمل مهمة “Clean” أولًا</li>\n<li>ثم تعمل “Build Frontend” و “Build Backend” (وكلتاهما تعتمد على “Clean”)</li>\n<li>وبعد اكتمال البناءين، تُنفَّذ “Run Tests” (وهي تعتمد على البناءين)</li>\n<li>وأخيرًا تكتمل “Full Pipeline” بعد انتهاء “Run Tests”</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>نصيحة</strong></p>\n<p>انتبه إلى حالات التسابق المحتملة عند استخدام <code>parallel</code> مع مهام قد تتعارض (مثل مهام تكتب في الملفات نفسها). وفي هذه الحالات، يكون <code>sequence</code> أكثر أمانًا.</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}